  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through COMMUNITY WELLBEING in Palestine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COMMUNITY WELLBEING is centered around offering psychosocial support and counselling sessions to target groups (majorly youth, PWDs, IDPs and women) dealing with trauma and stress to build their coping mechanisms and life skills. Furthermore, Youth-friendly spaces will also support youth in improving their wellbeing through interventions like sports, drama, art and music.</narrative>
  </description>
